   "subject": "סדנאת R ו- Big Data בתאריך ה-23.10.2014 (הכניסה חינם, בהרשמה מראש, המקומות מוגבלים)",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">(הודעה זו פורסמה ב: <a href=\"http://r-israel.com/2014/08/63\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-israel.com/2014/08/63&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2_r8I1ZL2L_XNa1EBFh281\">http://r-israel.com/2014/08/63</a> )<br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">שלום לכולם,</div><div dir=\"rtl\">\r\n\r\n<br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">(התנצלותי באם המייל הזה יגיע אליכם פעמיים)</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">\r\n\r\n<h3 dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\">ההרשמה</h3><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(34,34,34);background:transparent\">\r\n\r\nבהמשך לסדנאת ה-R המוצלחת <a href=\"http://r-israel.com/2014/05/51\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-israel.com/2014/05/51&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UjN1yhDl7oMxEIBKTw3qL\">על knitr ו- shiny</a>,</div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(34,34,34);background:transparent\"></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(34,34,34);background:transparent\">\r\n\r\nאנחנו שמחים להזמין אתכם לסדנה בנושא R ו- Big Data, בחסות  <a href=\"http://statistics.org.il/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://statistics.org.il/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2_Zv5g2uICU0Qg12hlylVa\">האיגוד הישראלי לסטטיסטיקה</a>, ו<a href=\"https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zqsRoWE73IlA-NpMT2WiN\">גוגל-קמפוס</a>.<br>\r\n\r\nהסדנה תועבר על ידי ד&quot;ר יונתן רוזנבלט ממכון וויצמן, ואדי אהרונוביץ מאוניברסיטת תל אביב.</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(34,34,34);background:transparent\">\r\n\r\n</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(34,34,34);background:transparent\">ההשתתפות היא בחינם, אך <span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration:underline;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">דורשת הרשמה מוקדמת</strong></span> בשני קישורים (סורי על הריבוי, אך אין ברירה):</div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(34,34,34);background:transparent\">1) עליכם ליצור <a href=\"https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zqsRoWE73IlA-NpMT2WiN\">שם משתמש באתר של גוגל-קמפוס</a> (ההרשמה היא בחינם, ובצד הימני העליון של המסך)</div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(34,34,34);background:transparent\">2) עליכם להירשם בגוגל-טופס שמופיע ב<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2vd40Kir5jm7lIJ6_EGlZ8\">קישור הישיר כאן</a>.</div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(34,34,34);background:transparent\"></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(34,34,34);background:transparent\">\r\n\r\nיש הגבלת מקום של 120 איש, אז אנא <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2vd40Kir5jm7lIJ6_EGlZ8\">מהרו להירשם.</a> לאחר שירשמו 120 הראשונים, ישלח אליהם מייל שמודיע שהם &quot;בפנים&quot;. לאחר מכן ההרשמה תישאר פתוחה ל&quot;רשימת המתנה&quot;, ובשבוע שלפני הסדנא נברר כמה אנשים לא יוכלו להגיע – ונזמין את האנשים מרשימת ההמתנה להגיע. בד&quot;כ כשליש (לפחות) מהאנשים מבטלים ברגע האחרון, אז הרבה מהאנשים של רשימת ההמתנה צפויים לקבל הזמנה להגיע (אז<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153);background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2vd40Kir5jm7lIJ6_EGlZ8\">תירשמו <img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/B8cb9azJm4sP1z2k_gv63Nf7Ptan5JWyozteorSEktfQHxmie4fgUY-L3tc0_MtNRFNjeJ1_0PQaUZwlyO0o8KFxGogQQ7xiS-EHbdTK9tIuJPlgRC7grLNCUMegbu8aROs_Cjip-T6f=s0-d-e1-ft#http://i0.wp.com/r-israel.com/wp-includes/images/smilies/icon_smile.gif?zoom=1.5&amp;w=640\" alt=\":)\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" style=\"border:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\"> </a>).</div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(34,34,34);background:transparent\"></div></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\">\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:transparent\">היכן?<br>\r\n\r\n</strong></h3><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">בגוגל קמפוס:</p><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0);background:transparent\">ELECTRA TOWER<br>98 YIGAL ALON ST. </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0);background:transparent\">TEL AVIV </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(0,0,0);background:transparent\">34TH FLOOR</span></p><h3 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\">\r\n\r\n<strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">מתי?</strong></h3><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">הסדנה תתקיים ביום חמישי, ה-23.10.2014 בין השעות 17:00-21:30</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">לו&quot;ז (טנטטיבי):</p><ul style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 1.5em 24px 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;list-style:square;background:transparent\">\r\n\r\n<li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">17:00-17:30: הגעה ומינגלינג</li><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">17:30-19:00: יונתן רוזנבלט</li>\r\n\r\n<li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">19:00-19:30: הפסקה</li><li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">19:30-21:00: אדי אהרונוביץ</li>\r\n\r\n<li style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">21:00-21:30: זמן אקסטרא לשאלות ומינגלינג</li></ul><h3 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\">\r\n\r\n<strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">קהל היעד?</strong></h3><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">\r\n\r\nמשתמשי R.</p><h3 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">נושאי הסדנא?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\"><span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration:underline;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">ד&quot;ר יונתן רוזנבלט</strong></span></h4>\r\n\r\n</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;background-image:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><div style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr;background:transparent\">\r\n\r\nWhether you call it &quot;<span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">BigData</span>&quot;, &quot;massive <span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">data</span>&quot;, &quot;<span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">huge</span> <span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">data</span>&quot; (see <a href=\"http://vimeo.com/91502942\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vimeo.com/91502942&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3S9DgUs2DA_rAlqXVH7mhl\">here</a>) etc. Many observations with many variables present a computational challenge.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr;background:transparent\">SAS, SPSS, and Revolutions provide fast and efficient implementations of out-of-memory algorithms for fitting statistical models.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr;background:transparent\">In this talk, I will present several open source implementations of these algorithms available as R packages. These include <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/LiblineaR/index.html\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/LiblineaR/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KI2rBIv1SXVDc6SBbjNAV\">LiblineaR</a>, <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RSofia/index.html\" style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RSofia/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZAj52UJiIB5_iYjaAaM5_\">RSofia</a>, and others (time permits).</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr;background:transparent\"></div><h4 style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;clear:both;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;background:transparent\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;text-decoration:underline;background:transparent\"><strong style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\">אדי אהרונוביץ&#39;</strong></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;background:transparent\"><p style=\"border:0px;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr;background:transparent\">The obvious way to process data is within the local computer, however, when we talk about analyzing “BigData”, we might face the usual compute and storage problems in an intensified manner.<br>\r\n\r\nIn this talk, an overview of the existing techniques to process distributed data and their R implementations will be presented.<br>No previous computer science knowledge is needed.</p></div></div></div><div style=\"direction:rtl\">\r\n\r\n<br></div><div style=\"direction:rtl\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:rtl\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:rtl\"><br></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br>\r\n\r\nContact me: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  <br>Read me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3AFJNha5iSoXG-tN7LOeqB\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ebES90zdG_FkMFYKeh0l0\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701448000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1DddnsBaouRiZ84Jo8O6kM\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)<br>\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
