     1,
     "<div dir=\"rtl\"><font size=\"4\">איפה אפשר לראות את החומר מהמצגת של יונתן רוזנבלט?</font><br><br>בתאריך יום חמישי, 21 באוגוסט 2014 09:55:30 UTC+3, מאת Tal Galili:</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"rtl\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;padding-left:1ex;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"rtl\">(הודעה זו פורסמה ב: <a href=\"http://r-israel.com/2014/08/63\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-israel.com/2014/08/63&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26ZRIGy108D_fXYX1IqOcm\">http://r-israel.com/2014/08/63</a> )<br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">שלום לכולם,</div><div dir=\"rtl\">\r\n\r\n<br></div><div dir=\"rtl\">(התנצלותי באם המייל הזה יגיע אליכם פעמיים)</div><div dir=\"rtl\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\"><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:24px;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\">\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);line-height:1.5em;clear:both;font-weight:normal;vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\">ההרשמה</h3><div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\">\r\n\r\nבהמשך לסדנאת ה-R המוצלחת <a style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(116,51,153);vertical-align:baseline\" href=\"http://r-israel.com/2014/05/51\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-israel.com/2014/05/51&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2UB-aVX0OC5CxbdlpCjCjV\">על knitr ו- shiny</a>,</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\"></div><div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\">\r\n\r\nאנחנו שמחים להזמין אתכם לסדנה בנושא R ו- Big Data, בחסות  <a style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(116,51,153);vertical-align:baseline\" href=\"http://statistics.org.il/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://statistics.org.il/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3anWel7r4OyHNAJb1kADRa\">האיגוד הישראלי לסטטיסטיקה</a>, ו<a style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(116,51,153);vertical-align:baseline\" href=\"https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ckD3a6thjWg9Je144DDWP\">גוגל-קמפוס</a>.<br>\r\n\r\nהסדנה תועבר על ידי ד&quot;ר יונתן רוזנבלט ממכון וויצמן, ואדי אהרונוביץ מאוניברסיטת תל אביב.</div><div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\">\r\n\r\n</div><div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\">ההשתתפות היא בחינם, אך <span style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;text-decoration:underline;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">דורשת הרשמה מוקדמת</strong></span> בשני קישורים (סורי על הריבוי, אך אין ברירה):</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\">1) עליכם ליצור <a style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(116,51,153);vertical-align:baseline\" href=\"https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ckD3a6thjWg9Je144DDWP\">שם משתמש באתר של גוגל-קמפוס</a> (ההרשמה היא בחינם, ובצד הימני העליון של המסך)</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\">2) עליכם להירשם בגוגל-טופס שמופיע ב<a style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(116,51,153);vertical-align:baseline\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0GssMxmdrRNb-1GuDDiUt5\">קישור הישיר כאן</a>.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\"></div><div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\">\r\n\r\nיש הגבלת מקום של 120 איש, אז אנא <a style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(116,51,153);vertical-align:baseline\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0GssMxmdrRNb-1GuDDiUt5\">מהרו להירשם.</a> לאחר שירשמו 120 הראשונים, ישלח אליהם מייל שמודיע שהם &quot;בפנים&quot;. לאחר מכן ההרשמה תישאר פתוחה ל&quot;רשימת המתנה&quot;, ובשבוע שלפני הסדנא נברר כמה אנשים לא יוכלו להגיע – ונזמין את האנשים מרשימת ההמתנה להגיע. בד&quot;כ כשליש (לפחות) מהאנשים מבטלים ברגע האחרון, אז הרבה מהאנשים של רשימת ההמתנה צפויים לקבל הזמנה להגיע (אז<a style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(116,51,153);vertical-align:baseline\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/161UgRRmXfCemID-cEYX-Ek4o0BotElzQ_XYd-8vM4Ys/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0GssMxmdrRNb-1GuDDiUt5\">תירשמו <img width=\"15\" height=\"15\" style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\":)\"> </a>).</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(34,34,34);vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\"></div></div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;line-height:24px;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\">\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;clear:both;font-weight:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(51,51,51);vertical-align:baseline\">היכן?<br>\r\n\r\n</strong></h3><p style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">בגוגל קמפוס:</p><p style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline\">ELECTRA TOWER<br>98 YIGAL ALON ST. </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline\">TEL AVIV </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);vertical-align:baseline\">34TH FLOOR</span></p><h3 style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;clear:both;font-weight:normal;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n\r\n<strong style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">מתי?</strong></h3><p style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">הסדנה תתקיים ביום חמישי, ה-23.10.2014 בין השעות 17:00-21:30</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">לו&quot;ז (טנטטיבי):</p><ul style=\"background:none;list-style:square;margin:0px 1.5em 24px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n\r\n<li style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">17:00-17:30: הגעה ומינגלינג</li><li style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">17:30-19:00: יונתן רוזנבלט</li>\r\n\r\n<li style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">19:00-19:30: הפסקה</li><li style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">19:30-21:00: אדי אהרונוביץ</li>\r\n\r\n<li style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">21:00-21:30: זמן אקסטרא לשאלות ומינגלינג</li></ul><h3 style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;clear:both;font-weight:normal;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n\r\n<strong style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">קהל היעד?</strong></h3><p style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n\r\nמשתמשי R.</p><h3 style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;clear:both;font-weight:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">נושאי הסדנא?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<h4 style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;clear:both;font-weight:normal;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;text-decoration:underline;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">ד&quot;ר יונתן רוזנבלט</strong></span></h4>\r\n\r\n</div><div style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;line-height:24px;font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px;vertical-align:baseline\" dir=\"rtl\"><div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\">\r\n\r\nWhether you call it &quot;<span style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">BigData</span>&quot;, &quot;massive <span style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">data</span>&quot;, &quot;<span style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">huge</span> <span style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">data</span>&quot; (see <a style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\" href=\"http://vimeo.com/91502942\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://vimeo.com/91502942&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701455000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tdU7EfrsY0XDA52uPCS1Q\">here</a>) etc. Many observations with many variables present a computational challenge.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\">SAS, SPSS, and Revolutions provide fast and efficient implementations of out-of-memory algorithms for fitting statistical models.</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\">In this talk, I will present several open source implementations of these algorithms available as R packages. These include <a style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\" href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/LiblineaR/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/LiblineaR/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701456000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2XTMoBzqrlK-lXtU1QX13A\">LiblineaR</a>, <a style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\" href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RSofia/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RSofia/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701456000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06d35Tpb_oEx1FcJIXeq5b\">RSofia</a>, and others (time permits).</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\"></div><h4 style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 20px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;color:rgb(0,0,0);line-height:1.5em;clear:both;font-weight:normal;vertical-align:baseline\">\r\n\r\n<span style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;text-decoration:underline;vertical-align:baseline\"><strong style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\">אדי אהרונוביץ&#39;</strong></span></h4>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background:none;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline\"><p style=\"background:none;margin:0px 0px 24px;padding:0px;border:0px currentColor;vertical-align:baseline;direction:ltr\">The obvious way to process data is within the local computer, however, when we talk about analyzing “BigData”, we might face the usual compute and storage problems in an intensified manner.<br>\r\n\r\nIn this talk, an overview of the existing techniques to process distributed data and their R implementations will be presented.<br>No previous computer science knowledge is needed.</p></div></div></div><div style=\"direction:rtl\">\r\n\r\n<br></div><div style=\"direction:rtl\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:rtl\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:rtl\"><br></div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br>\r\n\r\nContact me: <a rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  <br>Read me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701456000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tJMOdynmM3TyLo4FJi5bn\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701456000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1WXXf1cMwNKDv9S8_UuwuP\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.r-statistics.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497701456000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0vdnHCEQaU7gYwMrnjaqox\">www.r-statistics.com</a> (English)<br>\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br></div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
